exports[`Golden frames: search, tags, help > 5: WHEN at 80x24 ? is written THEN the frame contains Help - Keyboard Shortcuts, Move down, Search notes and Show / focus the tags pane, not Pinned note, and has at most 24 lines; snapshot help-80x24 > help-80x24 1`] = `
"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Help - Keyboard Shortcuts                                                   │
│  j       Move down                    E       Empty the trash (trash view)   │
│  k       Move up                      p       Pin / unpin                    │
│  Enter   Open note                    m       Markdown on / off              │
│  Tab     Next pane                    s       Sort: modified, created, a-z   │
│  q       Quit                         S       Reverse the sort order         │
│  v       Toggle rendered markdown pre /       Search notes                   │
│  ?       Show this help               t       Show / focus the tags pane     │
│  Escape  Close overlay / back         J       Move tag down (tags pane)      │
│  e       Edit in $EDITOR              K       Move tag up (tags pane)        │
│  n       New note                     R       Rename tag (tags pane)         │
│  g       Edit tags of the selected no x       Delete tag (tags pane)         │
│  w       Export note to .md           r       Sync now                       │
│  b       Send to blog as draft        P       Publish / unpublish            │
│  L       Log out (asks first)         y       Copy the public link           │
│  d       Move to trash                h       Note history (Enter restores   │
│  u       Restore from trash (trash vi c       Tick / untick item (note)      │
│  D       Delete forever (trash view)  a       Add checklist item (note)      │
│  T       Show trash / all notes       i       Edit inline (built-in editor   │
│  Found a bug? Run snote --report to save a report bundle.                    │
│  Editing: save with Ctrl+S and close the window to return                    │
│                                                                              │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
`;

